{"id":"81a15e6b69aa82ec","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-cohen-forcing.md","title":"可计算性语境中的 Cohen 条件","display":"df-cohen-forcing — 可计算性语境中的 Cohen 条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-cohen-forcing","aliases":["20-df-cohen-forcing"],"display":"df-cohen-forcing — 可计算性语境中的 Cohen 条件","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§6.3 Finite Extension Method；本地条件语义","source_pdf_pages":[171,172],"source_printed_pages":[137,138],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-cohen-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-cohen-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cohen-forcing — 可计算性语境中的 Cohen 条件"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§6.3 Finite Extension Method；本地条件语义"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>171</span><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>137</span><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(p,q\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathbb P_C:=(2^{&lt;\\omega},\\le_C),\\qquad q\\le_Cp\\Longleftrightarrow p\\preceq q,\\\\\np\\Vdash\\operatorname{Meet}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\preceq p\\ [\\sigma\\in S],\\\\\np\\Vdash\\operatorname{Avoid}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall q\\succeq p\\ [q\\notin S].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathbb P_C:=(2^{&lt;\\omega},\\le_C),\\qquad q\\le_Cp\\Longleftrightarrow p\\preceq q,\\\\\np\\Vdash\\operatorname{Meet}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\preceq p\\ [\\sigma\\in S],\\\\\np\\Vdash\\operatorname{Avoid}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall q\\succeq p\\ [q\\notin S].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>强条件是较长串。这里 forcing 只定义已显示的遇见／避开要求，不伪造对任意逻辑公式的完整 forcing 递归，也不使用未定义的 GenFilter。</p>\n<p>来源：§6.3 Finite Extension Method；本地条件语义；印刷页 137, 138；PDF 第 171, 172 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathbb P_C:=(2^{<\\omega},\\le_C),\\qquad q\\le_Cp\\Longleftrightarrow p\\preceq q,\\\\\np\\Vdash\\operatorname{Meet}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\sigma\\preceq p\\ [\\sigma\\in S],\\\\\np\\Vdash\\operatorname{Avoid}(S)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall q\\succeq p\\ [q\\notin S].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1338,"backlinks":[{"id":"8a59ed3a01d1c804","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cohen-forcing]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435"]}